game-life
=========

This repository contains original game engine code, UI, and a default
fantasy content pack ("灵元人生" / base pack).

Third-party / fan content packs
-------------------------------

Optional content packs (for example themed after commercial novels, games,
or other protected IP) are NOT part of the MIT-licensed default product.

- Do not commit or publish copyrighted text, names, or assets in this repo.
- Pack authors are solely responsible for rights clearance.
- The engine's integrity checks (SHA-256 / optional HMAC) only detect file
  corruption; they do not grant copyright permission or prove authenticity
  of untrusted third-party packs.

